ImmerseLearn", "VR", "Training"], "long_description": "Certified HVAC Associate is a comprehensive VR training app designed to provide hands-on experience in HVAC fundamentals. This interactive simulation covers:\n\n- Fire Extinguisher Essentials: Learn proper handling and usage.\n- Personal Protective Equipment (PPE) \u2013 Understand safety best practices.\n- Basic Tools & Equipment: Master essential HVAC tools.\n- Copper Tubing Essentials: Explore cutting, bending, and joining techniques.\n- Refrigeration System & Refrigerator: Understand system components and operation.\n- Electrical Components & Controls: Learn wiring and troubleshooting.\n- Wiring Diagram Interpretation: Develop skills in reading and applying diagrams.\n\nTrain in a risk-free, realistic environment that enhances learning and skill retention. Whether you're an aspiring technician or an industry professional, this app prepares you for real-world HVAC scenarios. Start your training today!", "short_description": "Master essential HVAC skills in an immersive VR training experience! Certified HVAC Associate covers fire extinguisher safety, PPE, tools, copper tubing, refrigeration systems, electrical components, wiring, and more. Train in a realistic virtual environment to enhance hands-on expertise, improve safety awareness, and build a strong foundation for a successful HVAC career."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://immerselearn.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Immerselearn", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://immerselearn.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1043107547362485"}, {"id": "514087707868786"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT"